      "timestamp_sec": 884,
      "why": "Reinterprets benchmark 'saturation' as measurement noise rather than capability ceiling."
    },
    {
      "text": "we believe that writing is just too rich and deep and nuanced and frankly human of an activity to measure with mechanical benchmarks and LM as a judge doesn't really work either because LLMs don't have good taste in writing",
      "timestamp_sec": 922,
      "why": "States the design thesis behind Hemingway Bench and a clear anti-LLM-judge position."
    },
