      "text": "it is quite expensive, right? Human eval is very expensive. Getting the time of these professionals is quite expensive. But again, our goal is to maximize quality, not to minimize costs.",
      "timestamp_sec": 964,
      "why": "Names the central tradeoff the talk asks the industry to accept."
